</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROCEDURALLY GENERATED MAZES \u25d5\u203f\u25d5</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/cb5b20bb4c32fa385eb8e5653b100b27.poster.avif?t=1760960078\" width=780 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/cb5b20bb4c32fa385eb8e5653b100b27.webm?t=1760960078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new maze is generated each time you play: every game is unique!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VARIOUS THEMES \u25d5\u203f\u25d5 *</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a selection of themes to change the scenery, or leave it to chance!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACE YOUR FRIENDS IN A VARIETY OF GAME MODES \u25d5\u203f\u25d5</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COINS RUSH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/83c8c14f5174f799f5e7bc449ff4f488.poster.avif?t=1760960078\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/83c8c14f5174f799f5e7bc449ff4f488.webm?t=1760960078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect as many coins as possible and jump into the hole at the center of the maze to score them. Smash crates to obtain unique power-ups that will help you beat your opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RACE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/77808d10f26109ca8cf88fe5553eaadf.poster.avif?t=1760960078\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/77808d10f26109ca8cf88fe5553eaadf.webm?t=1760960078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the other end of the maze before your opponents to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLINDFOLDED *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to find your way in the dark before your opponents to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAYHEM *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for your life in the maze and hit as many opponents as you can to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BATTLE ROYALE *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last Marbie standing wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MARBALL *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basically play football... except <i>you</i> are the ball. Score as many points as you can to beat the other team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRAWING *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reproduce the picture as best you can by rolling in the snow. The most accurate artist wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SKILL *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll you way to the opposite side of the maze without falling!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Q\u0338\u0306\u0312\u030d\u0350\u0344\u0357\u0342\u0346\u0359\u0317\u032e\u0329\u0319\u0332\u0322\u032a\u032dl\u0334\u0360\u030b\u033e\u030d\u0308\u0304\u035d\u0301\u033e\u0352\u033f\u0329\u0333\u0331\u0328\u033a\u0328\u0323\u0327\u032b\u031e\u032bJ\u0336\u035d\u0305\u0303\u0352\u0305\u033e\u0306\u0304\u0316\u032d\u0359\u034d\u0331\u0339\u033bF\u0334\u030d\u0341\u0314\u0360\u0357\u0344\u030e\u034d\u0356\u031c\u033c\u031d\u0316Q\u0337\u0304\u0344\u0309\u0309\u030a\u034c\u0302\u0344\u0301\u0306\u0328\u0317\u032a\u033a\u031d\u031c\u033c\u0324U\u0338\u031b\u034a\u033a\u031d\u0322\u032b\u0327s\u0336\u0306\u034c\u0340\u0314\u035d\u034b\u0304\u0352\u0301\u034b\u0354\u032a\u032eg\u0337\u0315\u0358\u0350\u0350\u0317U\u0335\u0306\u034c\u0311\u0359\u0324\u0324\u0326\u0355\u0318\u0325\u032f\u0332\u0359\u0317\u033c\u0325\u031fk\u0334\u033d\u0320\u032c\u0330\u0324\u03199\u0334\u0312\u0307\u0311\u0344\u0343\u034c\u0320\u0349\u0319\u0354\u0316\u0326\u0327\u0339\u0319\u032f\u0349P\u0336\u030c\u033a\u0349\u031e\u0326\u032a\u034e\u031c\u0333\u0355\u031e\u0321\u0326\u0318T\u0334\u0352\u0343\u031a\u0352\u0358\u0313\u0309\u035d\u0358\u0350\u0344\u030e\u0327\u031e\u035c\u0348\u0323\u0329\u0328\u0355\u0348\u0355\u032d\u0353\u031fQ\u0335\u0314\u033d\u0305\u030b\u030b\u0314\u035d\u0302\u030c\u030e\u035d\u0306\u0348\u0322\u0325\u0348\u0326\u032f\u0331=\u0335\u0300\u0301\u031a\u034a\u0302\u0358\u0309\u035d\u0306\u0303\u0311\u0315\u034b\u0314\u035a\u035a\u034e\u0328\u0328\u0353\u033c\u0359\u0345\u0324\u0317\u0348=\u0337\u0304\u035b\u0341\u0340\u0358\u035d\u0304\u0352\u0305\u031a\u031f\u0331\u0327\u0317\u033a\u0331\u0317 \u0334\u0309\u0343\u0304\u035d\u0304\u031a\u032d\u0354\u035a\u031d\u032e\u031f\u0333\u0347\u031c\u0316\u2299\u0337\u033d\u034b\u0358\u033d\u030e\u033d\u035d\u0342\u0352\u035d\u0302\u0344\u0302\u0305\u034e_\u0334\u0312\u035b\u0314\u030b\u0346\u030e\u0352\u0333\u035a\u031c\u0317\u034e\u2299\u0335\u0303\u0357\u0314\u0314\u0302\u034a\u0304\u0305\u0347\u0320\u0345\u0328\u0359\u0331\u0330\u0339\u0356\u0345\u0323</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >V\u0335\u030b\u0347G\u0338\u0352\u0328h\u0336\u0346\u0355l\u0334\u030d\u031cc\u0337\u030c\u031fm\u0338\u0303\u0348U\u0337\u034a\u035cg\u0335\u034a\u0317b\u0336\u0311\u0331W\u0336\u030b\u033aF\u0336\u030a\u03165\u0335\u0360\u035cI\u0335\u030f\u032fG\u0334\u033d\u0345J\u0335\u0312\u0355l\u0